.TH KOMIND 8 "2026-08-21" "komin-terminal 1.0.0" "System Manager's Manual"
.SH NAME
komind \- Komin Terminal Daemon (D-Bus system service)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B komind
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B komind
is the foreground daemon for Komin-Terminal. It publishes three D-Bus services
(chat, history, user) on the system bus and processes AI queries from the
.BR km (1)
CLI.
.PP
In production, the daemon is activated by systemd as a
.B Type=dbus
service. It can also be run directly for development and testing.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-config " PATH"
Load the specified configuration file exclusively, replacing the default
system and user configuration paths. Useful for testing or running the
daemon with a custom configuration.
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Enable debug-level logging (equivalent to \fBlogging.level=debug\fR in the
configuration file).
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show program version and exit.
.SH SIGNALS
.TP
.B SIGTERM, SIGINT
Graceful shutdown: the daemon stops the D-Bus server, disposes of the
database connection and exits cleanly.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/komin/config.yaml
System-wide configuration file.
.TP
.I /var/lib/komin/komin.db
SQLite database for chat history persistence.
.TP
.I /var/lib/komin/
Runtime data directory (created by tmpfiles.d).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B KOMIN_DBUS_VENDOR
D-Bus vendor segment (default: \fBexample\fR in development,
replaced at build time by RPM \fB%{_vendor}\fR macro).
.TP
.B KOMIN_SYSTEM_CONFIG_DIR
Override the system configuration directory.
.TP
.B KOMIN_SQLITE_PATH
Override the SQLite database path.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR km (1),
.BR systemd.service (5),
.BR dbus-daemon (1)
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/komin/komin-terminal/issues
